{"Bindings apply to the game only. Menus keep the fixed layout (right face button select, bottom face button back), and the in-game menu always opens with the back button or the menu button on the screen, or the controller's Back + Start held together, or its Home / Guide button - so this page can't be locked out. The game's button icons follow the controller bindings.",
